cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite it and the airoa-org/airoa-moma dataset.
title: "robot-vlm-generalization"
abstract: >-
  Leakage-safe fine-tuning and evaluation of a vision-language model (Qwen3-VL-2B, LoRA) on real robot video:
  skill recognition and success detection, with splits held out by operator and by robot, controls,
  conformal prediction sets and 4-bit inference.
type: software
authors:
